{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAQdJxJgwp4e2Bpb1ujN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed `Hijack()` so it works again after only the response headers have been sent. It now refuses only once body bytes have been written. The change isn't committed yet.\n\n**The bug:** `Hijack()` refused with an error whenever `Written()` was true, and `Written()` is already true after just the header is sent. Websocket libraries such as coder/websocket send a `101 Switching Protocols` header and then hijack, so they always got `gin: response already written`.\n\n**Changed:**\n- `response_writer.go`: the guard is now `w.size > 0` instead of `w.Written()`, with a short comment explaining why. I also changed the error text to `gin: response body already written`. The error variable isn't exported, but callers can see the message, so it counts as a small visible change.\n- `response_writer_test.go`: new case \"hijack after header write should succeed\", which sends a 101 header and then hijacks.\n\n**Verified:**\n- The new case failed before the fix with the old error.\n- With the test kept and only the source change reverted, it fails again.\n- `go test ./...` passes in every package, `go vet` is clean and `gofmt -l` reports nothing.\n- The existing \"hijack after write should fail\" case still passes, so hijacking after body bytes are written is still refused.\n\n**Not done:** I didn't run the repo's golangci-lint config. I can commit this as `fix(response): refine hijack behavior for response lifecycle` if you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":766,"cache_read_input_tokens":38401,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":766,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0af8832c-3813-48d8-ab21-423bea0926f0","uuid":"b8ef0b43-1bd1-475c-97ee-ea4b38b589e0","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:25:11.302Z","request_id":"req_011CgAQdJjQQbWudEafYuZ59"}
